    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5289" root="جذ" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَذٌّ</span></b>  <i>A piece broken off; a fragment:</i> pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَجْذَاذٌ</span>:
so in the phrase, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَسَرْتُهُ أَجْذَاذًا</span> [<i>I broke it in
pieces,</i> or <i>fragments</i>]; occurring in a trad., relating
to an idol. (L.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُذَاذٌ</span>.]

